'''I RULE!''' is [[challenge]] #26. Isaac starts off with {{i|Key Piece 1}}, {{i|Key Piece 2}}, {{i|Trinity Shield}}, {{i|Mom's Knife}}, {{i|The Ladder}}, and {{i|The Boomerang}}. The goal is to defeat {{E|Mega Satan}}. The Boss Room containing {{E|???}} or {{E|The Lamb}} does not appear. This is the only challenge in [[Hard Mode]].

== Difficulty ==
With a powerful set of items to start with, this is a rather easy challenge after getting used to Mom's Knife. The most difficult challenge here is defeating Mega Satan.

== Strategy ==
* Because Mom's Knife overrides many other items, finding powerful synergies may prove challenging.
** {{R|Angel Room}}s/{{R|Devil Room}}s can yield items that synergize with Mom's Knife (such as {{i|Godhead}}, {{dlc|a+}}{{i|Holy Light}}, or {{i|Brimstone}}).
** {{R|Boss Rush}} and {{s|???}} can provide additional chances at good items.
* As a result of beginning the challenge with both Key Pieces, Angel Rooms are much more likely to appear than normal.
* {{dlc|na+}} It is somewhat easier to beat this challenge with {{i|The Polaroid}} (which doesn't appear after the Mom fight in ''Afterbirth †'') than it is with {{i|The Negative}}, as {{E|Isaac}} is an easier fight than {{E|Satan}} in this challenge. Furthermore, the {{s|Chest}} can provide many chances at useful items that the {{s|Dark Room}} does not.
* {{dlc|r}} The {{E|Red Chest}}s in the Dark Room now offer Devil Deals, granting powerful items at the cost of [[Health#Red Heart Containers|Red Heart Containers]].

== Notes ==
* {{Dlc|nr}} Despite being forced to take {{I|The Negative}}, the {{s|Cathedral}} can still be accessed; however, once {{E|Isaac}} is defeated and the chest is entered, the run will simply end and will not count as a completion of the challenge.
** {{Dlc|r}} Only the path to {{s|Sheol}} will appear after defeating {{E|Mom's Heart}} / {{E|It Lives!}}.
* {{dlc|a+nr}} If the player starts the challenge before {{I|The Polaroid}} and {{I|The Negative}} have been unlocked, then the player has to use an {{R|I AM ERROR}} room, or a {{R|Sacrifice Room}} to advance to Mega Satan.
* {{dlc|a+}} Killing {{E|Delirium|n}} will count as completing the challenge.

== Reward ==
{{achievement text | Poker Chip }}

== Trivia ==
* This challenge is an homage to the original ''The Legend of Zelda'', which this game is inspired by.
** The items given in this challenge are meant to replicate Link's equipment from said game.
** The title of the challenge is a play on "Hyrule", the kingdom in which most ''Zelda'' games take place.

